  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 401.06 Certificate of Authorization Renewal. Certification of authorization for the practice of engineering shall expire on the last day of the month 2 years from the month of issuance. A renewal notification shall be sent to all engineering certified business organizations at least one month prior to expiration by the OPLC.\n\nSource. #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-22\n\nNew. #13859, eff 3-26-24",
